    "body": "I don't expect we will allow sites to know when other sites have access to the same device since that could violate the same-origin policy. In some cases it may be possible to determine this from the device behavior itself, like the microphone mute example you described. However, it probably shouldn't be part of the API.\r\n\r\nAt the operating system level, applications can avoid this issue by requesting exclusive access to a HID device. WebHID doesn't support an exclusive access mode yet but I think it's likely we'll add it at some point to reduce the potential for interference and improve security when applications are accessing sensitive devices like headsets.",
